  "description": "Engwe X26 folding electric bicycle is your ultimate companion for thrilling off-road adventures. With it, you can ride freely and enjoy speed and comfort.\nStandout Features of Engwe X26\nHere are some standout features that make Engwe X26 a must-have for any outdoor enthusiast.\n\nRobust Hub Motor: With a powerful 1200W peak hub motor, this collapsible e bike is ready to tackle any challenge.\n\nPowerful Battery Options: Choose between a high-capacity 48V 19.2Ah single battery or an enhanced dual-battery system (48V 19.2Ah and 10AH) designed to extend ride time and extend range, and this long-range e-bike won't leave you with any range anxiety.\n\nImpressive Torque & Speed: Delivering a robust 70 N.m torque, the ENGWE X26 effortlessly climbs hills and accelerates quickly, reaching speeds of up to 31 MPH.\n\nAdvanced Braking System: Equipped with front and rear hydraulic brakes for enhanced safety and reliability, ensuring you stop on a dime even in challenging conditions.\n\nTriple Suspension System: Experience unparalleled comfort with a triple suspension that offers three times more shock absorption than standard e-bikes, smoothing out the roughest trails. If you prefer a smooth and comfortable riding experience, this full suspension electric bike will be your ideal choice.\n\nAll-Terrain Tires: The 26.0X4.0 inches fat tires provide excellent traction, enabling you to conquer various rough terrains with ease.\n\nAdventure awaits with the ENGWE X26 fat tire electric bike.",
